# Project Context System — a separate, self-contained dev tool with its own git repo.
/Project context system/

# PCS project memory — a LOCAL sidecar, kept out of the app repo so code bundles never bloat it.
# It updates live via the git post-commit hook; move it between machines with `pcs export`/`import`,
# not git. Remove this line only if you deliberately want memory committed with the app.
.project-memory/
